1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
A true story.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:06,225
A builder of human connection enters a system
that reduces a life to a file.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,550
Part I ended with a line
connecting people.

4
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:12,963
Here, it became a ruled line
on a form.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,538
I had crossed countries
and returned home to build.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,250
After fifty closed doors,
one company hired me almost by accident.

7
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:30,209
COVID broke the foothold.

8
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:34,300
Three weeks of policy collided
with seven years of savings.

9
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:38,250
On the way out, I asked,
“Can I finally buy government bonds?”

10
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:41,150
Brussels opened a remote door.

11
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:46,900
The work gathered speed before I had arranged
the life around it;

12
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,250
I was already inside long calls
before I had an accountant.

13
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,753
KATA became the last lawful bridge
back into work from Hungary.

14
00:00:59,833 --> 00:01:02,250
The law moved in a day.

15
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:05,200
Taxpayers had weeks
to rebuild their work.

16
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,650
The client still needed delivery,
so I issued an advance invoice.

17
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:22,100
My accountant, the administration and I
saw different screens.

18
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:24,000
The route that seemed to work
demanded my government password.

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,727
The risk stayed with me.

20
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:29,150
On 23 November, a newspaper article
made me check the updated tax system.

21
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:33,200
One trail stopped where another began;
the warning sat where I could not see it.

22
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:36,250
Months of failure took one week
to understand.

23
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:41,800
In one call, everything collapsed into:
“I can no longer have a child.”

24
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:47,281
I corrected the return, paid the tax
and ended the representation.

25
00:01:47,733 --> 00:01:52,350
One sentence became the case;
the dignity I was trying to defend vanished.

26
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:56,500
For months of foot pain,
the public answer was a shoe and another year.

27
00:01:56,500 --> 00:02:01,000
I borrowed from my parents for surgery,
then spent three months in bed.

28
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,526
Almost a year later,
the bell would not stop.
